    - MIT license (LICENSE-MIT)
  at your option.

  crates/einst-plugin is licensed under the GNU General Public License,
  version 3 or later (LICENSE-GPL-3.0): it exports a VST3 plugin through
  nih-plug's VST3 bindings, which are GPLv3.

Binaries
  Einst.app, Einst.vst3 and Einst.clap are built from einst-plugin and are
  therefore distributed under the GNU General Public License, version 3 or
  later (LICENSE-GPL-3.0).

Artwork
  assets/ui (skin, stylesheets, icon font, cursors, metronome clicks) is a
  copy of Dreist's UI graphics with Einst's names, under the same
  MIT OR Apache-2.0 terms; assets/ui/Fonts/Liberation Sans*.ttf are under
  the SIL Open Font License 1.1 (assets/ui/Fonts/OFL-LiberationSans.txt).
  assets/ui-v1, the v1-layout UI set, is generated by scripts/uigen from
  Einst's own layout source and theme and is under the same terms (its
  fonts as in assets/ui).

Factory data
  assets/factory holds the original instrument's factory effect presets,
  effect chains and pattern and swing templates, bundled as they are. They
  are not covered by the licences above; this repository is private.
